 t-term?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Onsite at Yale Library Special Collections\, New Haven\, Connectic
 ut\, USA. Open to academic and independent scholars locally and globally\,
  regardless of institutional association.
