DESCRIPTION:Mondriaan Fund grant for written and/or spoken-word publication
 s about contemporary visual art: article series\, long reads\, podcasts\, 
 video essays\, social-content series\, and similar formats published acros
 s magazines\, newspapers\, online platforms\, public media or social media
 . Aimed at strengthening reflection on\, criticism of\, and journalism aro
